# Stable spec ID: punch-martinez. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(gin; London dry) 1 1/2 oz
(vermouth; sweet red) 1 1/2 oz
(maraschino liqueur) 1 tsp
(bitters @ Angostura) 2 dashes

::equipment
(mixing glass)
(serving vessel) = (coupe) -OR- (cocktail glass)

::instructions
<stir, measured ingredients with ice in (mixing glass)>
<strain, into a chilled (serving vessel)>
<garnish, with orange peel>

